UID:6a133b85703c33630029a5f9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Author Mary Natale leads a fun storytime including poetry and 
 a craft\, highlighted by a reading of her new picture book\, Tumbleweed: t
 he Fairy Without Wings.\nCopies of Tumbleweed\, the Fairy Without Wings wi
 ll be available for sale at the end of the program.\nAll children welcome\
 , although program content is intended for children 4 - 7 years of age.\n
 Limited space for craft activity. First sixteen (16) children to arrive c
 an sign up to participate in the arts and craft activity.
