DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260731T150000
UID:6a17686d0c0f2c4503fb7c79@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:What do you see when you walk through your community? Have you
  ever thought about building something for your community that would have 
 a positive impact on the people living there? Put on your thinking cap and
  use your imagination to design and build something that would make your c
 ommunity stronger! Plus\, enter a prize draw for a chance to win an awesom
 e book. For kids ages 4 to 12. Space is limited.\nDrop in until capacity.
LOCATION:Barbara Frum\, 3rd Floor\, Room B
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a17686d0c0f2c4503fb7c79
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
