BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Punjabi Music on Harmonium
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260801T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260801T150000
UID:6a50f93c0d65ac36003ebed0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Punjabi Melodies on Harmonium is a live musical performance ce
 lebrating the rich cultural and spiritual heritage of Punjab through soulf
 ul singing and traditional harmonium music. Performed by Amandeep Sharma\,
  this program blends the timeless beauty of Punjabi folk and classical sou
 nds with heartfelt vocals that speak to universal themes of love\, devotio
 n\, and human connection. The performance aims to introduce audiences to t
 he depth and diversity of Punjabi music and Harmonium instrument. All ages
  are welcome!\nRegistration is required via tpl.ca or by calling 416-396-8
 943.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Multipurpose Room\, 1 st floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a50f93c0d65ac36003ebed0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
