BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TD Summer Reading Club - Book Reporting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T235959
UID:6a3a1877c026ff22477c0360@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:June 20th - August 31st.\nAges 0 - 13.\nSummer Reading Club is
  here\n!  Register your child for the club and receive a TDSRC book report
 ing workbook\, stickers\, and more to get the most out of your summer read
 ing. Kids will be able to\nreport 2 books per day\nduring the book reporti
 ng times and for\nevery 5 books reported they will receive an entry for a 
 grand prize\n! Find fun activities in branch all summer long and online at
 \ntdsummerreadingclub.ca\n. This years theme is SET SAIL! Explore the worl
 ds waterways\, its creatures and the world of reading all summer long.\nAt
 tend a program and book report after! Please check branch hours before you
  visit!\nReporting Times (during branch hours):\n11:00 - 12:00pm\, 3:00 - 
 4:00pm and 6:00 - 7:00pm.\nFrench Reading Challenge:\nWanna earn some spec
 ial prizes? For every book you read in French you'll be entered to win a s
 pecial prize pack! Learn more about FRC in branch.\nIn-branch Activities:
 \nScavenger Hunt - Can you find all the pieces of your TDSRC workbook hidd
 en in the children's area? Test your perception with our scavenger hunt!\n
 Colouring Sheets - Colour to you hearts content with TDSRC themed colourin
 g sheets. Set sail with your imagination to create something amazing!\nCan
  you spot the signs of Summer? - Want a challenge? Use your skills to loca
 te signs of summer on our find-it display!
LOCATION:Bendale\, Main Floor - Information Desk and Children's Area
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3a1877c026ff22477c0360
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
