 ing picture book\nThe Magic Cap/Le Bonnet Magique\n. Then\, create your ow
 n take-home 'Hedgehog With a Magic Cap' craft.\nAges: 3 to 9.\nSpace is li
 mited.\nRegistration is required. Register online through the tpl websit
 e\, or call 416-393-7720\, or you can visit the Riverdale branch in person
 .\nDaycares and Camps\, please call 416-393-7720 to inquire.\nInformation 
