BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop - Pollution Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260827T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260827T150000
UID:6a07649f8360de907d875903@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever think about the impact of one little person or one
  tiny thing on the planet? When one pollutant becomes many\, the planet hu
 rts. But when one person becomes many\, positive change can happen. In thi
 s workshop\, you will design and build your own creature or machine that w
 ill help keep our precious planet clean! Plus\, enter a prize draw for a c
 hance to win an awesome book.\nFor kids ages 4 to 8. Space is limited. Reg
 istration begins June 1st.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal i
 nformation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under t
 he Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informat
 ion will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and ev
 aluation. Questions about how the library handles your information can be 
 directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 
 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Cliffcrest
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a07649f8360de907d875903
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga Storytime for kids
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T150000
UID:69c68cc62866a5b48844bddc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Appleseed Yoga presents an interactive\, movement-based progra
 m where stories come alive with our bodies! Class begins and ends with son
 g and breathwork and is filled with pages of creativity and activity. No e
 xperience\, mats\, or materials required.\nAges 4-8. Registration required
LOCATION:Richview\, Lower Level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c68cc62866a5b48844bddc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
