BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:STEAM: Ride 'n' Roll with Science
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260819T150000
UID:6a3aa8da90cc4e3a791024c7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the amusement park – where we’ll be bumping\, s
 pinning\, zipping and rolling! Discover the actions and reactions of bumpe
 r cars. Explore the forces at work when you spin. Create a zipline while i
 nvestigating gravity. Design a roller coaster to meet a challenge. It’s 
 all about the physics of riding ‘n’ rolling!\nFor kids ages 4-12. Spac
 e is limited.\nGentle Reminder:\nDue to high demand\, we kindly ask you to
  arrive on time so everyone has a chance to participate. Spots may be offe
 red to those waiting after\n5 minutes.\nThank you for your understanding a
 nd cooperation!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information 
 on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public L
 ibraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will on
 ly be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Q
 uestions about how the library handles your information can be directed to
  Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Stree
 t\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Eglinton Square\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3aa8da90cc4e3a791024c7
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
