BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yoga Storytime with Appleseed Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260827T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260827T150000
UID:69fa359bc6a1dc3d00d1a958@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for an interactive\, movement-based program where w
 e read stories and make them come alive with our bodies! Appleseed Yoga fo
 r Kids will deliver inspiring stories that get the whole family moving. Cl
 ass begins and ends with song and breathwork and is filled with pages of c
 reativity and activity. Kids and families can sit quietly and listen\, do 
 partial poses or make up their own\, following our lead. It's ALL yoga! No
  experience\, mats\, or materials required.\nFree tickets will be distribu
 ted from the front desk 30 minutes prior. All children welcome
LOCATION:Runnymede
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fa359bc6a1dc3d00d1a958
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mireille Messier: Le Bonnet Magique
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260814T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260814T150000
UID:6a2b06bdc7d3cd58005faf26@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Gnomes\, hérisson et magie? Oh oui! Venez rencontrer l'autric
 e jeunesse Mireille Messier qui lira son album primé Le bonnet magique. P
 uis\, créez un bricolage de hérisson à apporter à la maison.\nÂge : 3
  à 9\nGnomes and hedgehogs and magic\, oh my! Join bilingual author Mirei
 lle Messier as she read her award-winning picture book The Magic Cap/Le bo
 nnet magique. Then\, create your own take-home 'Hedgehog With a Magic Cap'
  craft.\nProgram intended for ages: 3 to 9\nAccessibilité:\nLe sous-titra
 ge en direct ou automatique\, l’interprétation en langue des signes\, l
 es services d’intervenant\, ou les services d’accompagnement sont disp
 onibles sur demande. Veuillez soumettre votre demande au moins deux semai
 nes à l’avance à : tpl.ca/accessibility-events
LOCATION:Leaside\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2b06bdc7d3cd58005faf26
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
