BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mini Zine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260821T150000
UID:6a285f5e1e67cd9cb338b417@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A mini zine is a self-published\, DIY miniature booklet usuall
 y made from a single sheet of paper. They can be about any topic (art\, po
 etry\, comics\, rants) and are easily photocopied and shared. Come to crea
 te your own “book”. For ages 4-12.\nRegistration required.\nInformatio
 n Collection Notice:\nThe Personal Information on this form is collection 
 by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20
 (a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and p
 rogram registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the lib
 rary handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nansw
 erline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.​
LOCATION:Woodside Square\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a285f5e1e67cd9cb338b417
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:L'Heure du conte / French Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T110000
UID:69c6d129b48451fc3c0baab2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Rejoignez-nous pour des histoires\, des chansons et des compti
 nes en français pour les enfants âgés de 0 à 5 ans\, accompagnés de l
 eurs parents et responsables. Les familles sont invitées à rester et à 
 jouer pour 30 minutes supplémentaires après la conclusion du programme.\
 nEnjoy stories\, songs and rhymes in French at a staff-led story time for
  children age 0-5 with their parents and caregivers. Families are welcome 
 to "stay and play" for an additional 30 minutes following the program.\n--
 -------\nLe sous-titrage en direct ou automatique\, l’interprétation en
  langue des signes\, les services d’intervenant\, ou les services d’a
 ccompagnement sont disponibles sur demande. Veuillez soumettre votre dema
 nde au moins deux semaines à l’avance à : tpl.ca/accessibility-events.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c6d129b48451fc3c0baab2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
